{"meta":{"id":"err-archive:1609527932","type":"series","name":"Kadunud pruut","poster":"https://s.err.ee/photo/orig/2024/11/28/2636203hf112.jpg","background":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2024/11/21/2628073h805dt34.jpg","genres":["Krimi"],"description":"Kümme aastat suurt ehitusfirmat juhtinud edukas ärinaine Anna Tvardovskaja valmistub abielluma linna peaarhitekti Dmitri Beloviga. Kohe on algamas uhke pulmapidu, ent sugugi mitte kõik peokülalised ei jaga tulevaste abikaasade rõõmu. Dmitri tütar Julia ei taha, et ta isa abielluks uuesti ajal, mil ema ei ole traumeerivast abielulahutusest veel üle saanud. Anna eksämm jällegi pelgab, et Dmitri võib Annaga abielludes Tvardovskite perefirmale käpa peale panna. Pulmad saavad mõningastest viperustest hoolimata siiski peetud, ent järgmisel hommikul pärast pidu on Anna jäljetult kadunud.","videos":[{"id":"err-archive:1609527935","title":"Kadunud pruut","season":1,"episode":1,"thumbnail":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2024/11/21/2628073h805dt34.jpg","released":"2024-11-21"},{"id":"err-archive:1609531718","title":"Kadunud pruut","season":1,"episode":2,"thumbnail":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2024/11/27/2635315h81fet34.png","released":"2024-11-25"},{"id":"err-archive:1609531721","title":"Kadunud pruut","season":1,"episode":3,"thumbnail":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2024/11/27/2635321hba1bt34.png","released":"2024-11-25"},{"id":"err-archive:1609531724","title":"Kadunud pruut","season":1,"episode":4,"thumbnail":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2024/11/27/2635327h4c8et34.png","released":"2024-11-25"},{"id":"err-archive:1609531727","title":"Kadunud pruut","season":1,"episode":5,"thumbnail":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2024/11/27/2635330hb06dt34.png","released":"2024-11-25"},{"id":"err-archive:1609531730","title":"Kadunud pruut","season":1,"episode":6,"thumbnail":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2024/11/27/2635318he6det34.png","released":"2024-11-25"},{"id":"err-archive:1609536764","title":"Kadunud pruut","season":1,"episode":7,"thumbnail":"h